aipicam-config (1.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * Ships /etc/aipicam/streams.conf as the shared source of truth for
    picam-raw's camera stream dimensions and ports, read by
    picam-orchestrator, picam-hailo, and picam-recorder.

